msgstr "Yeniden denemenin tetiklenip tetiklenmediği"

#: inc/Engine/Admin/PerformanceMonitoring/Abilities/RetestPageInsights.php:104
msgid ""
"Current job status: running = test already in flight; triggered = retest "
"queued; not_found = URL not tracked; failed = error"
msgstr ""
"Şu anki iş durumu: running = deneme zaten uçuşta; triggered = yeniden deneme"
" kuyruğa alındı; not_found = URL izlenmedi; failed = hata"

#: inc/Engine/Admin/PerformanceMonitoring/Abilities/RetestPageInsights.php:108
